    "text": "By Jamie Kemble ,\n21 hours ago Roy Keane has been backed to take over the Celtic job should Martin O'Neill leave the club, and it may be the right call at the right time. O'Neill future remains unclear after a run of three straight defeats that has included two Old Firm derby defeats either side of a defeat to Ferencvaros in their Europa League opener. Read full article",
